ublic poll shows Dembo ahead by five to nine points, but all come from Democratic-aligned sponsors, which likely overstates his standing. Independent raters split between toss-up and lean Republican, and prediction markets give Alvarado a narrow edge. The race sits just on the Republican side of even, with turnout in Lexington and surrounding counties likely to decide it.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.2515, "margin": -3.92}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.296, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.2877, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2982, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.223, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.2389, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.2735, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.2956, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.2849, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.3514, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.3215, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.3486, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.3422, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.3273, "margin": -2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.3239, "margin": -2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.2888, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.3735, "margin": -2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.3134, "margin": -2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.2858, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.3394, "margin": -2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.4042, "margin": -2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.4073, "margin": -1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.4033, "margin": -1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.3315, "margin": -2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.3273, "margin": -2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.3431, "margin": -2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.3907, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-19", "p_dem": 0.3966, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-1